186045417] [17592186559858 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559858 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the intersection point of the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ with equations\n\n$$\nl:r=⟨4,1,6⟩+t⟨2,6,0⟩,\\,Π:r\\cdot ⟨-24,8,6⟩=-32.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559858 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "c9dd16b9-4054-5136-a332-5517b98207e0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559858 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's write the equation of the line as\n\n$$\nr=⟨4+2t,1+6t,6⟩.\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $r=⟨4+2t,1+6t,6⟩$ into the equation of the plane, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot ⟨-24,8,6⟩ & =-32 \\\\ ⟨4+2t,1+6t,6⟩\\cdot ⟨-24,8,6⟩ & =-32 \\\\ -24(4+2t)+8(1+6t)+6\\cdot 6 & =-32 \\\\ -96-48t+8+48t+36 & =-32 \\\\ -52 & =-32.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation has no solution. Therefore, we conclude that the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ do not intersect." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559904 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186559948 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559904 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "17f1e51d-aa7f-5439-b877-0e6bb77db4bf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559904 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186559858 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559913 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186559974 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559913 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "2c8a2fa0-140a-5e16-9bdf-6e1de01aec40" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559913 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186484201 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559948 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186559913 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559948 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "85bcb97e-37af-5ca8-9d58-81d4ae0c6fbe" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559948 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186402256 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559959 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186559904 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559959 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "ae8d1bdd-e6e6-5260-8dba-9c55868390df" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559959 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186304971 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559974 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "d89e8710-7753-5df9-a5a6-86101a7dcce9" #e